{"Title":"An Act authorizing the Massachusetts Teachers’ Retirement System to grant credible service to Kellie Martin","BillNumber":"H3812","DocketNumber":"HD4166","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AFC1","Name":"Antonio F. D. Cabral","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AFC1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-17T16:14:18.397"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AFC1","Name":"Antonio F. D. Cabral","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AFC1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-17T16:14:18.3966667"},{"Id":"C_H1","Name":"Christopher Hendricks","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-17T16:19:38.4566667"},{"Id":"MCM0","Name":"Mark C. Montigny","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MCM0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-21T16:04:08.2866667"},{"Id":"WMS1","Name":"William M. Straus","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WMS1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-24T10:35:45.59"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"C_H1","Name":"Christopher Hendricks","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/C_H1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-17T16:14:18.397"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3812/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representatives Cabral of New Bedford and Hendricks of New Bedford, a petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Antonio F. D. Cabral, Christopher Hendricks and Mark C. Montigny for legislation to authorize the Massachusetts Teachers’ Retirement System to grant credible service to Kellie Martin.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Massachusetts Teachers’ Retirement System shall credit Kellie Martin, an employee of the New Bedford Regional Vocational Technical High School, with 3 years of creditable service for the period of August 28th, 2003 to August 28th, 2006 for experience in the occupational field required to teach in a department approved vocational program, for the purpose of determining her retirement allowance. Before the date that any retirement allowance becomes effective for Kellie Martin, she shall pay into the annuity savings fund of the Massachusetts Teachers’ Retirement System in 1 sum or installments, upon such terms and conditions as the board may prescribe, an amount equal to that which would have been withheld as regular deductions from her regular compensation for such previous service. \r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H34","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H34"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[{"AmendmentNumber":"1","ParentBillNumber":"H3812","Branch":"House","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3812/Branches/House/Amendments/1/"}]}